    chore: update upstreams (#861)
    
    * chore: update upstream metadata
    
    * fix(shims): build against TypeScript 7.1.0-dev.20261015.1
    
    Upstream moved signature type parameters, structured-type index infos and
    value-symbol write types into cold storage, and added a self-referencing
    free list to Checker.
    
    - 003-checker-exports.patch reads type parameters via Signature.TypeParameters().
    - The TypeScript provider reads index infos through a linkname to
      StructuredType.getIndexInfos; the legacy provider keeps the field.
    - Drop the unused ValueSymbolLinks.writeType field shim.
    - gen_shims emits each extra struct once, so cyclic unexported pointers
      terminate, and names embedded unexported fields it expands to literals.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * fix(shims): mirror paged typeNodeLinks and generic arena fields
    
    Upstream stores typeNodeLinks in an unexported nodeLinkStore and adds
    arenas over unexported extra structs to Checker.
    
    - The TypeScript provider reads typeNodeLinks through the extra_Checker
      mirror as a NodeLinkStore; the legacy provider keeps the field accessor.
    - gen_shims expands unexported type arguments of exported generic fields.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * chore(nix): pin TypeScript 257e874 in the flake
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
